d near +10 until the passes."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "Every command only inspects the current position or records: current-position-liberties.js (inspectLiberties) lists existing chains and their liberties, and the `check`/`turn` wrappers apply the single named move, test legality and captures, then call play. The remaining scripts do bookkeeping (move list, allocation point-sets, record replay, SGF, notes via apply_patch), and nothing ranks candidate moves or looks ahead.", "stop": false}}